abstract: >-
  A one-dimensional, non-isothermal, multicomponent dynamic pressure swing
  adsorption and vacuum pressure swing adsorption model for transparent
  research, numerical qualification, independent-case generation, and guarded
  coupling to steady-state process simulators.
